---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';

// Keep this page in step with what the site actually uses (CLAUDE.md › Standing rules).
// Add OpenFreeMap (Travel map) and Instagram embeds when those features go live.
const updated = '8 November 2026';
---

<Base title="Privacy · Jeymarc Sison" description="What this website collects and which services it uses.">
  <article class="mx-auto max-w-2xl px-5 pb-32 pt-36">
    <p class="text-[13px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-accent">Privacy</p>
    <h1 class="mt-3 text-5xl font-semibold tracking-tight">Privacy notice</h1>
    <p class="mt-4 text-muted">Last updated {updated}</p>

    <div class="prose-like mt-12 space-y-10 text-lg leading-relaxed">
      <section>
        <h2>The short version</h2>
        <p>
          This is a personal website. It sets no cookies, has no ads, and doesn't track you across sites. It only
          collects what you send through the contact form, and what the services below need in order to run.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Who is responsible</h2>
        <p>Jeymarc Sison, Switzerland. You can reach me through the contact form on this site or on LinkedIn.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Hosting: Vercel</h2>
        <p>
          The site is hosted by Vercel Inc. (USA). Like any web host, Vercel processes your IP address and browser
          details to deliver pages and keep the service secure, and keeps short-lived server logs.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Visitor statistics: Vercel Web Analytics</h2>
        <p>
          I count page views with Vercel Web Analytics. It uses no cookies. Visitors are told apart by a hash of the
          request, which is discarded after 24 hours, so I can't identify you or follow you over time.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Contact form: Cloudflare Turnstile and Resend</h2>
        <p>
          When you start using the contact form, a spam check from Cloudflare Turnstile loads. It processes your IP
          address and browser details to tell people from bots. It doesn't load if you never touch the form.
        </p>
        <p>
          Your name, email address and message are sent through Resend, Inc. (USA), which keeps email data for
          30 days, to my personal mailbox, where they're stored. I use your details only to reply to you, and delete the conversation when it's
          no longer needed.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Your rights</h2>
        <p>
          Under the Swiss Federal Act on Data Protection (FADP) and, where it applies, the GDPR, you can ask what I
          hold about you, have it corrected or deleted. Use the contact form or LinkedIn.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </article>
</Base>

<style>
  .prose-like :global(h2) { font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -0.01em; margin-bottom: 0.75rem; }
  .prose-like :global(p + p) { margin-top: 1rem; }
  .prose-like :global(p) { color: var(--c-muted); }
</style>
